(1. Executive Summary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ADR-001 selected an Open edX Hybrid approach: Open edX is a bounded operational LMS/runtime ) Tj
T*
(substrate, not the strategic product core. ADR-002 defines the permanent architecture that ) Tj
T*
(makes that decision safe.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Open edX is not Syrka. Open edX delivers learning experiences and captures educational ) Tj
T*
(activity. Syrka transforms those activities into human capability intelligence, career ) Tj
T*
(mobility, institutional analytics, workforce planning, and cross-border capability corridors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The architectural philosophy is:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Syrka owns all intelligence. Ontologies, capability graphs, inference, career intent, ) Tj
T*
(market signals, national strategy alignment, recommendations, passports, and workforce ) Tj
T*
(mobility are Syrka-owned systems.) Tj
T*
(2. The LMS is replaceable. Open edX must remain behind an anti-corruption layer. Syrka must ) Tj
T*
(never depend directly on Open edX tables, internal APIs, event names, or implementation-) Tj
T*
(specific identifiers.) Tj
T*
(3. Events are the backbone. Learning activity becomes canonical Syrka events. Canonical events) Tj
T*
( become evidence. Evidence becomes capability claims. Capability claims become ) Tj
T*
(recommendations, credentials, job passports, and mobility decisions.) Tj
T*
(4. Each domain has one owner. No entity, table, event, or API may have shared ownership. ) Tj
T*
(Domains may reference each other by stable identifiers and consume each other's events, but ) Tj
T*
(they do not mutate each other's data.) Tj
T*
(5. AI decisions require provenance. No capability inference, opportunity recommendation, ) Tj
T*
(curriculum recommendation, or mobility judgment is accepted without evidence, confidence, ) Tj
T*
(explanation, model/version metadata, and bias/safety review.) Tj
T*
(6. Syrka protects its IP by owning the semantic layer. The proprietary value is not course ) Tj
T*
(delivery. It is the capability ontology, graph, inference engine, market alignment, career ) Tj
T*
(intelligence, passport, and corridor logic.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
