T*
(16. Final Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Syrka's permanent architecture is a domain-driven, event-driven, AI-native platform in which ) Tj
T*
(Open edX is only the Learning Management bounded context. Open edX stops at course delivery, ) Tj
T*
(assessment operations, gradebook mechanics, enrolments, discussions, attendance capture, and ) Tj
T*
(raw educational activity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Syrka begins at canonical event ownership, ontology, graph, inference, career intent, market ) Tj
T*
(intelligence, national vision alignment, dashboards, portfolios, opportunities, passports, ) Tj
T*
(credentials, mobility, public profiles, and cross-border corridors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(All future engineering work must preserve the replaceability of Open edX. Any proposal that ) Tj
T*
(places Syrka ontology, capability inference, graph state, job passport logic, employer ) Tj
T*
(intelligence, workforce mobility, or national strategy logic inside Open edX violates this ADR) Tj
T*
( unless superseded by a later accepted ADR.) Tj
ET
endstream
